          <details>
            <summary>Will the purification program help me lose weight?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">While weight loss is a common result, the primary focus is to help the body detoxify and establish healthier eating habits.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do I stick to the program when eating away from home?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">Plan ahead by checking menus or bringing your own compliant snacks and meal replacements.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Why can't I substitute different vegetables than what are outlined?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">The specific vegetables chosen are selected for their nutritional profile and detoxifying properties.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What can I do if I am tired or lack energy while on the program?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">Ensure you are eating enough calories and drinking plenty of water. Consult your healthcare professional if fatigue persists.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What can I do for temporary constipation?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">Increase your water and fiber intake, and ensure you are moving your body daily.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Why is there lactose in SP Complete?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">SP Complete contains small amounts of whey protein which contains natural lactose. We also offer dairy-free options.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is the Standard Process Purification Program vegetarian?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">The program can be adapted for vegetarians using specific supplement versions.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if I am allergic to certain foods on the list?
            </summary>
            <div class="content">Always follow the guidance of your healthcare practitioner and avoid foods you are allergic to.
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if there are continued health issues?
            </summary>
